OL,3,APoundland owner in crunch talks with
OL,4,Abusiness secretary as retailer's
OL,5,Acollapse looms
OL,6,
OL,7,FA meeting was due to be held on
OL,8,FThursday but has been brought forward
OL,9,Fas the scramble to secure a rescue deal
OL,10,Ffor the firm intensifies.
OL,12,FGordon Brothers has previously said
OL,13,FPoundland faces multiple economic
OL,14,Fchallenges from rising inflation,
OL,15,Fincreasing staff costs, and "severe
OL,16,Flevels of shoplifting".
